 'Sustained-tone music treats duration, closely controlled pitch and the interaction of held tones as form. Tony Conrad’s amplified violin work supplies the selected bowed-string practice model. Drone also includes electronic and other instrumental practices; this default is neither dark ambient nor a comprehensive instrument roster for all drone music.',
 ['violin_orchestral'],dict(bowed_technique='bowed_legato_classical',orch_setup_period='modern_setup_violin',orch_bow='modern_bow',orch_articulation='arco_orch'),[],'droneModal.string',[-2,2,-2,-2,0,0,0,1,0,-2,1,-2,-2],
