 [source('https://www.tableoftheelements.co.uk/tcc-08-four-violins-1964','Tony Conrad — Four Violins (1964) — Table of the Elements',['Conrad’s amplified strings introduced sustained just-intonation drone into minimal music in 1962.','The Dream Syndicate employed long duration and precise pitch; Conrad recorded Four Violins on 19 December 1964.']),source('https://www.centrepompidou.fr/en/ressources/oeuvre/4ajqUIg','Four Violins — Centre Pompidou',['Four sessions of amplified violin were overdubbed.','The artist’s recording studio was 56 Ludlow Street, New York, on 19 December 1964.'])],
