 ['Tim Hecker — Ravedeath, 1972 (2011)','Tim Hecker — Harmony in Ultraviolet (2006)'],['experimentalElec.musiqueConcrete','experimentalElec.industrialNoise'],[45.5019,-73.5674,'Montréal','North America'],
